            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Jakobo wakaambila Simeoni a-Levi kuti, Mwandifwabya, nkaambo mwandinunsya akati kabantu bakede munyika, ba-Kanana aba-Perizi, Mebo, tuli bace buyo. Balayoboloka akundilwisya, lino njoonyonyooka, mebo aluzubo lwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
